26:38.858 --> 26:40.686
[pintu dibuka]

26:42.818 --> 26:44.603
[pintu ditutup]

26:44.864 --> 26:46.300
- Hei.
- Oh, sial [ketawa]!

26:46.517 --> 26:48.258
