37:25.504 --> 37:27.723
[tembakan dilepaskan]

37:27.941 --> 37:31.510
[objek berdenting]
[muzik dramatik]

37:38.517 --> 37:41.998
- [Grace] Ibu, saya takut <i>.</i>

37:42.216 --> 37:44.174
