42:02.215 --> 42:03.608
- Kawan awak?

42:03.825 --> 42:04.739
- Tidak.

42:06.219 --> 42:06.785
- Ayuh.

42:14.575 --> 42:17.360
[guruh berdentum]

42:17.578 --> 42:18.187
- Awak dulu.

42:18.492 --> 42:19.798
- Okay.</i>

42:20.015 --> 42:21.060
- Saya akan berada di belakang awak.

42:21.277 --> 42:22.104
- Okay.
