43:00.403 --> 43:01.796
- Gerakkan ia.</i>

43:02.014 --> 43:03.232
Ayuh.

43:04.407 --> 43:05.278
[api menyala]

43:05.539 --> 43:07.628
[wanita mengerang]

43:09.325 --> 43:10.718
- Mereka mendapat Mary.

43:10.936 --> 43:14.809
[Mary merengus]
